{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.tm_descended_is_holonomy","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.tm_descended_is_holonomy","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.tm_descended_is_holonomy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.tm_descended_is_holonomy","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/tm_descended_is_holonomy.lean#L69-L90","doc":"**Descended term = unknot-core holonomy**\n    ([`lem:topological-mass-holonomy`]).\n\n`MI∫_Σ τ̂ₙ(α) = Hol_{∇A}(ϱ₀; 𝔊)` with `τ̂ₙ(α) = pullback β`.  *Derived*\n(not assumed): factorise over the blow-up decomposition, show each\nexceptional-disc factor is trivial from naturality and collapse, collapse\nthe ordered product, then apply Stokes on the spanning disc. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:topological-mass-holonomy","label":"lem:topological-mass-holonomy","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/topological-mass-holonomy.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.descended_exceptional_disc_trivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.descended_exceptional_disc_trivial","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/tm_descended_is_holonomy.lean#L55-L67","doc":"**Exceptional discs contribute trivially (derived).**  A pulled-back\n(descended) integrand has trivial multiplicative integral over every\nexceptional disc: naturality moves the integral to the blow-down image,\nwhich is a point, where the multiplicative integral is the identity. ","signatureChunk":0}]}